Read the repository-root `AGENTS.md`, `docs/design-system.md`, `docs/team-workflow.md` and the assigned task. For UI, load `.agents/skills/expo-design-system/SKILL.md` and follow `docs/apple-native-ui.md` plus `docs/native-ui-validation.md`.

All agents share one Apple-native design: NativeTabs on mobile, system typography, shared theme/components and appropriate Liquid Glass with accessibility fallback. This rule adds no separate design system or authority for external actions. Work in root `src/` unless explicitly assigned another project.
